
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 用户代码
    participant Session as Session
    participant Agent1 as SimpleAgent
    participant Agent2 as SimpleAgent
    participant LLM as OpenAIClient
    participant Memory as SimpleMemory
    participant ToolReg as ToolRegistry
    
    Note over User: 1. 初始化阶段
    User->>Session: __init__(agents=[agent1, agent2])
    Session->>Memory: __init__(max_messages=100)
    Session->>Session: 存储agents和shared_memory
    
    User->>Agent1: __init__(name='分析师', system_prompt='...')
    Agent1->>LLM: __init__(api_key='sk-...', model='gpt-4')
    Agent1->>Memory: __init__(max_messages=50)
    Agent1->>Agent1: 设置默认属性和工具
    
    User->>Agent2: __init__(name='程序员', system_prompt='...')
    
    Note over User: 2. 添加工具（可选）
    User->>ToolReg: register_tool(search_web)
    User->>Agent1: add_tool(search_web)
    
    Note over User: 3. 运行多智能体任务
    User->>Session: run(task='分析AI趋势并生成代码')
    
    Note over Session: 4. 任务执行循环
    loop 每个对话轮次
        Session->>Session: _select_next_agent()
        Session->>Memory: get_messages(limit=10)
        Memory-->>Session: 返回历史消息
        
        Session->>Agent1: generate_response(input_text, context)
        Agent1->>Agent1: _process_messages(context)
        Agent1->>LLM: chat_completion(messages)
        LLM-->>Agent1: 返回LLM响应
        
        Agent1->>Agent1: 检查工具调用
        alt 需要调用工具
            Agent1->>ToolReg: get_tool(tool_name)
            ToolReg-->>Agent1: 返回工具函数
            Agent1->>Agent1: 执行工具函数
            Agent1-->>Agent1: 工具结果
            Agent1->>LLM: chat_completion(带工具结果)
            LLM-->>Agent1: 返回最终响应
        end
        
        Agent1->>Agent1: 创建Message对象
        Agent1-->>Session: 返回Message
        
        Session->>Memory: add_message(message)
        Session->>Session: _broadcast_to_agents(message)
        
        Session->>Session: 检查停止条件
    end
    
    Session-->>User: 返回最终结果
    
    Note over User: 5. 获取历史记录
    User->>Session: get_message_history()
    Session->>Memory: get_messages(limit=None)
    Memory-->>Session: 返回所有消息
    Session-->>User: 返回消息历史